<SCENARIO VER="105">
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "5000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\蝉。夕空。.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "BGM" "1000" "5000" "PASS"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "SE\紙ペラ.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\新聞.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<TXSPN>―It was after Golden Week that the incident became public.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Girl A's family's car had been left on the summit, and the four of them were missing.<PG>
Rumor has it that right next to the car on the summit, four unnaturally grown cherry trees were found, along with the clothes of the four.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\モトキザクラ様.gal" "WAIT" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Perhaps Girl A and her family, being worshippers, prayed at that shrine without seeing the warning on the signboard.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
So even if you see Motokizakura-sama, you mustn't speak to her, touch her, or put your hands together to her.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And you mustn't go back the way you came.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But since most Motokizakura-sama are good guardian deities,
{STOPSND "BGM" "5000" "PASS"}
it's said that it's best to pray quietly, in your heart.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\スチル\ろうそく.gal" "WAIT" "1" "5000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\death_sound3.ogg" "BGM2" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"That's the end. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">That's the best I could do!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\新村本家居間暗い.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花頭かく.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "アイテム2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\ろうそくの明かり.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "100" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Hey, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">. How does this story connect to </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">'s story from before?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Lots of Motokizakura-sama are guardian deities, so maybe one helped pass on the message of the high-school girl who jumped in front of the train."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I got by with an offhand answer.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腕組み.gal" "WAIT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"I see. If there are lots of Motokizakura-sama, that makes for all kinds of versions of the urban legend, and all kinds of interpretations too."</STYLE>
{WAIT "100" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{DELETECG "文字カウント画像" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<PG>
{}
<EVENT VALUE="MESEND">
